  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall objective is to foster the enabling conditions for migration to contribute to transformative pathways for sustainable development, by enhancing migrants&apos;, diasporic actors&apos; and their partners&apos; transformative capacities and contributions to sustainable development, and by harnessing evidence, dialogue and cooperation on migration to contribute to transformative pathways for sustainable development in the Mediterranean.</narrative>
  </description>
